From c4bd312bed0bc261429499f0b7231c1dbcfa95d1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Charles Hoskinson <charles.hoskinson@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 14:55:53 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 09/12] sherlock-lfr: I10 E2 gate at the L_Fr parameter set
 (PublicAir, D-2)

PublicAir exposes the D-2 public words (L vk pre-hash). The whole L verifier
tape of the real L proof proves at the L_Fr set with 2 commitments and the
stock verifier accepts; a changed public word and a changed L proof byte are
refused. D3 at the measured key: 101.1435 bits.
